// Copy to Secrets.xcconfig and fill in. That file is gitignored; this one is documentation.
//
// Allim deliberately requires no API keys. YouTube, TikTok and Vimeo thumbnails come from
// public oEmbed and CDN endpoints, and tagging runs on-device or through the local MCP
// server, which uses the Claude Code subscription rather than a key.
//
// ALLIM_EXAMPLE_KEY = your-value-here
